{{also|Persona non grata}}
==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|la|-}} {{m|la|persōna||person}} + {{m|la|nōn||not}} + {{m|la|grāta}} (from {{m|la|grātus||acceptable}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/pə(ɹ)ˈsəʊnə nɒn ˈɡɹɑːtə/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|personae non gratae|head=persona non grata}}

# A person who is not [[welcome]], especially a [[diplomat]] in a [[foreign]] [[country]].

====Usage notes====
Sometimes incorrectly pluralized as [[personas non grata]].

====Antonyms====
* {{l|en|persona grata}}

